# Repomix dumps the whole codebase into one file. A stale copy in version
# control misleads anyone who clones -- it was committed here from June and
# still described code that had since changed -- and the next run could just
# as easily sweep up a .env.
repomix-output.*

# 只有「全新使用者走一遍」那一關會用到的建置產物（frontend/src/test/firstrun.browser.test.ts）。
dist-firstrun/
# 同一關每次跑都會重建的資料庫。
backend/firstrun_walk.db

# Terraform（infra/）。**state 是明文的**，而且裡面有 Neon 給的那一串
# postgresql://使用者:密碼@… ——這個 repo 是公開的。
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
.terraform/
.terraform.lock.hcl
*.tfvars
